     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">You can save time and money with every tool change by using just one tool presetter and tool measuring machine. Pair it with ZOLLER TMS Tool Management Solutions to open up even more options to reduce costs.</p> <p class=\"extra-large-text\">Measured and preset tools reduce machine tool downtime by at least 15 %. You save a minimum of $15,000 per CNC machine, per year, per shift. That is why ZOLLER tool presetting and measuring machines pay for themselves within a short period of time.</p> <p class=\"extra-large-text\">Calculate the potential savings for your shop now with the ZOLLER profitability calculator.</p>",
