   "html": "<div class=\"content-inner\"> <a id=\"c45318\"></a> <div id=\"calculator\"> <div class=\"intro\"> <p>Enter the appropriate values for your company and find out how much money you can save with a ZOLLER solution in combination with TMD Tool Management Solutions. At the end, we will show you the payback period for your investment in your tool presetting and measuring device. </p> </div> <form> <input id=\"economy-hidden-field\" name=\"\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"All fields must be filled in\"/> <div class=\"row row-wrapper\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6\"> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-7\"> <label for=\"calculator_machine_count\">CNC machine tools</label> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5\"> <div class=\"row-input\"> <div class=\"col-xs-10\"> <div class=\"field\"> <select id=\"calculator_machine_count\" name=\"machine_count\"> <option value=\"\"></option> <option value=\"1\">1</option> <option value=\"2\">2</option> <option selected=\"selected\" value=\"3\">3</option> <option value=\"4\">4</option> <option value=\"5\">5</option> <option value=\"6\">6</option> <option value=\"7\">7</option> <option value=\"8\">8</option> <option value=\"9\">9</option> <option value=\"10\">10</option> <option value=\"11\">11</option> <option value=\"12\">12</option> <option value=\"13\">13</option> <option value=\"14\">14</option> <option value=\"15\">15</option> <option value=\"16\">16</option> <option value=\"17\">17</option> <option value=\"18\">18</option> <option value=\"19\">19</option> <option value=\"20\">20</option> <option value=\"21\">21</option> <option value=\"22\">22</option> <option value=\"23\">23</option> <option value=\"24\">24</option> <option value=\"25\">25</option> <option value=\"26\">26</option> <option value=\"27\">27</option> <option value=\"28\">28</option> <option value=\"29\">29</option> <option value=\"30\">30</option> </select> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-7\"> <label for=\"calculator_tool_changes\">Tool change per shift and machine</label> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5\"> <div class=\"row-input\"> <div class=\"col-xs-10\"> <div class=\"field\"> <select id=\"calculator_tool_changes\" name=\"tool_changes\"> <option value=\"\"></option> <option value=\"1\">1</option> <option value=\"2\">2</option> <option value=\"3\">3</option> <option value=\"4\">4</option> <option value=\"5\">5</option> <option value=\"6\">6</option> <option value=\"7\">7</option> <option value=\"8\">8</option> <option value=\"9\">9</option> <option value=\"10\">10</option> <option value=\"11\">11</option> <option value=\"12\">12</option> <option value=\"13\">13</option> <option value=\"14\">14</option> <option value=\"15\">15</option> <option value=\"16\">16</option> <option value=\"17\">17</option> <option value=\"18\">18</option> <option value=\"19\">19</option> <option selected=\"selected\" value=\"20\">20</option> <option value=\"21\">21</option> <option value=\"22\">22</option> <option value=\"23\">23</option> <option value=\"24\">24</option> <option value=\"25\">25</option> <option value=\"26\">26</option> <option value=\"27\">27</option> <option value=\"28\">28</option> <option value=\"29\">29</option> <option value=\"30\">30</option> </select> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-7\"> <label for=\"calculator_saving_toolchange_minutes\">Tool change time (minutes)</label> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5\"> <div class=\"row-input\"> <div class=\"col-xs-10\"> <div class=\"field\"> <select id=\"calculator_saving_toolchange_minutes\" name=\"saving_toolchange_minutes\"> <option value=\"\"></option> <option value=\"1\">1</option> <option value=\"2\">2</option> <option selected=\"selected\" value=\"3\">3</option> <option value=\"4\">4</option> <option value=\"5\">5</option> </select> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"> <div class=\"info\"> <img src=\"https://www.zoller.info/_assets/0d43b51864417824fcf5ebd7b561b543/Images/Info-Icon.svg\"/> <span>Studies in the automotive industry have shown that it takes an average of 4.52 minutes to change a tool.</span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-7\"> <label for=\"calculator_days_work_year\">Working days per year</label> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5\"> <div class=\"row-input\"> <div class=\"col-xs-10\"> <div class=\"field\"> <select id=\"calculator_days_work_year\" name=\"days_work_year\"> <option value=\"\"></option> <option selected=\"selected\" value=\"200\">200</option> <option value=\"210\">210</option> <option value=\"220\">220</option> <option value=\"230\">230</option> <option value=\"240\">240</option> <option value=\"250\">250</option> <option value=\"260\">260</option> </select> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-7\"> <label for=\"calculator_shifts\">Shifts per day</label> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5\"> <div class=\"row-input\"> <div class=\"col-xs-10\"> <div class=\"field\"> <select id=\"calculator_shifts\" name=\"shifts\"> <option value=\"\"></option> <option selected=\"selected\" value=\"1\">1</option> <option value=\"2\">2</option> <option value=\"3\">3</option> </select> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6\"> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-7\"> <label for=\"calculator_currency\">Currency</label> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5\"> <div class=\"row-input\"> <div class=\"col-xs-10\"> <div class=\"field\"> <select id=\"calculator_currency\" name=\"currency\"> <option data-iso-currency=\"EUR\" data-position=\"after\" data-symbol=\"€\" value=\"€\">€ (EUR)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"USD\" data-position=\"before\" data-symbol=\"$\" value=\"$\">$ (USD)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"CAD\" data-position=\"before\" data-symbol=\"$\" value=\"$\">$ (CAD)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"MXN\" data-position=\"before\" data-symbol=\"$\" value=\"$\">$ (MXN)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"GBP\" data-position=\"before\" data-symbol=\"£\" value=\"£\">£ (GBP)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"RUB\" data-position=\"after\" data-symbol=\"₽\" value=\"₽\">₽ (RUB)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"TRY\" data-position=\"after\" data-symbol=\"₺\" value=\"₺\">₺ (TRY)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"INR\" data-position=\"before\" data-symbol=\"₹\" selected=\"selected\" value=\"₹\">₹ (INR)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"BRL\" data-position=\"before\" data-symbol=\"R$\" value=\"R$\">R$ (BRL)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"JPY\" data-position=\"before\" data-symbol=\"¥\" value=\"¥\">¥ (JPY)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"CNY\" data-position=\"before\" data-symbol=\"¥\" value=\"¥\">¥ (CNY)</option> </select> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-7\"> <label for=\"calculator_hour_day\">Hours per shift</label> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5\"> <div class=\"row-input\"> <div class=\"col-xs-10\"> <div class=\"field\"> <div class=\"field\"> <input class=\"number-only\" id=\"calculator_hour_day\" min=\"1\" name=\"hour_day\" type=\"text\" value=\"8\"/> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-7\"> <label for=\"calculator_machine_costs\">Machine hourly rate (<span class=\"currency\"></span>)</label> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5\"> <div class=\"row-input\"> <div class=\"col-xs-10\"> <div class=\"field\"> <input class=\"number-only\" id=\"calculator_machine_costs\" min=\"1\" name=\"machine_costs\" type=\"text\" value=\"75\"/> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-7\"> <label for=\"calculator_invest_costs\">Investment in a ZOLLER tool presetting device(<span class=\"currency\"></span>)</label> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5\"> <div class=\"row-input\"> <div class=\"col-xs-10\"> <div class=\"field\"> <input class=\"number-only\" id=\"calculator_invest_costs\" min=\"1\" name=\"invest_costs\" type=\"text\" value=\"20000\"/> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-7\"> <label for=\"calculator_productivity\">Additional savings through tool management software (%)</label> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5\"> <div class=\"row-input\"> <div class=\"col-xs-10\"> <div class=\"field\"> <input class=\"number-only\" id=\"calculator_productivity\" min=\"1\" name=\"productivity\" type=\"text\" value=\"5\"/> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"> <div class=\"info\"> <img src=\"https://www.zoller.info/_assets/0d43b51864417824fcf5ebd7b561b543/Images/Info-Icon.svg\"/> <span>Tool management software can increase your productivity by at least 5%—this has been confirmed by research conducted by RWTH Aachen University (Rheinisch-Westfälische Technische Hochschule Aachen).</span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"field-wrapper\"> <div class=\"field submit\"> <button class=\"block-button\" id=\"calc-submit\">Determine your potential savings now </button> </div> </div> </form> <hr/> <div class=\"results\"> <div class=\"result\"> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-8 col-sm-8 col-md-9\"> <p>Your savings per year with a ZOLLER presetting and measuring machine</p> <span class=\"sub sub_money_lost\">test</span> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-4 col-sm-4 col-md-3\"> <div class=\"field\"> <span class=\"currency\"></span><span class=\"calc_result3\"></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"result\"> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-8 col-sm-8 col-md-9\"> <p>Additional savings with ZOLLER TMS Tool Management Solutions</p> <span class=\"sub sub_savings\"></span> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-4 col-sm-4 col-md-3\"> <div class=\"field\"> <span class=\"currency\"></span><span class=\"calc_result5\"></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"result total\"> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-8 col-sm-8 col-md-9\"> <h3 class=\"h3\">Total savings with ZOLLER</h3> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-4 col-sm-4 col-md-3\"> <div class=\"field\"> <b><span class=\"currency large\"></span><span class=\"large calc_result_total\"></span></b> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"result\"> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-8 col-sm-8 col-md-9\"> <p>Payback period for the presetting and measuring machine</p> <span class=\"sub sub_roi\"></span> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-4 col-sm-4 col-md-3\"> <div class=\"field\"> <span class=\"calc_result4\"></span> Years </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>",
