   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Simply more profit </h2>",
   "body": "<p><strong>Your savings calculation is based on the following parameters:</strong></p><ul><li><p>ZOLLER guarantees you savings of at least $15,000 per machine, per year, per shift if preset tools are used</p></li><li><p>According to a study by RWTH Aachen<strong> University(Rheinisch-Westfälische</strong> <strong>Technische Hochschule</strong>Aachen), tooling costs amount to 10% of the machine value per year</p></li><li><p>With ZOLLER TMS Tool Management Solutions you can increase your productivity by at least 5%.</p></li></ul>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/1/csm_kosteneffizienz_einzel_en_01_a17aa14a5e.webp",
