  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> How ZOLLER tool presetting and measuring machines optimize machine tool utilization </h2>",
   "body": "<p>4.52 minutes of machine downtime per hour and machine are caused by tools that are insufficiently preset, measured, and prepared. </p> <p>A ZOLLER tool presetting and measuring machine changes this paradigm. Every tool measurement is fast and precise. All tools arrive at the machine tool perfectly prepared. Machine downtime decreases and machining time increases so the time gains add up over the year to a measurable increase in productivity.</p> <p>For the example calculations, we have reduced the time loss to 3 minutes per hour and take into account 15 to 25 tool changes per day.</p> <p><strong>Calculation formula per machine:</strong> <br/>Time saving in minutes x tool change x shifts x hourly rate</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/5/csm_smile_header_c846e8a6b4.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1080,
     "h": 930
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c4270",
   "bg": "lightgray",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "small"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> TMS Tool Management Solutions ensure 5% more productivity </h2>",
   "body": "<p>With ZOLLER TMS Tool Management Solutions, you can increase your productivity by at least 5 % - this has also been shown in studies by RWTH Aachen<strong> University(Rheinisch-Westfälische</strong> <strong>Technische Hochschule</strong>Aachen). With the help of your machine's hourly rate, you can determine what this increase in productivity brings to your company - in hard cash, per machine!</p> <p><strong>Calculation formula: </strong><br/>8 hours/day x shifts/year x hourly rate x 5%</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/3/csm_toolmanagement_03_56a9f7c10c.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1220,
     "h": 1250
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c4271",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "small"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> 2 % less tooling costs per year </h2>",
   "body": "<p>Studies by the RWTH Aachen<strong> University(Rheinisch-Westfälische</strong> <strong>Technische Hochschule</strong>Aachen) show that ten years of tooling costs for a machine tool is the same as the cost of the machine itself.</p> <p>With ZOLLER TMS Tool Management Solutions you can save 20% of these tool costs - that's 2% of the machine purchase price per year in savings! A glance at the tool costs in your company's annual balance sheet will show you the extent of your savings potential.</p> <p><strong>Calculation formula: </strong><br/>Machine costs x 2%</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/8/csm_ToolingSolutions_preview_3ac60ed7ab.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1080,
